  "step_3": "The decision reason requires consideration of the maximum magnitude outcome and its probability-weighted value. The individual in the verbal report does not mention the maximum outcomes or their weighted values (e.g., 2500 × 0.33 vs. 2400 × 1.00). Instead, the justification centers on the risk of losing everything (the 1% zero outcome) and the small profit differences, indicating a focus on risk aversion rather than on the weighted maximum magnitude. Therefore, the individual did not use the decision reason. The information considered and the justification provided are inconsistent with the rule of the decision reason. Hence, the decision reason was not used.",
  "final_assessment_score": 0
